Find Chennai customers whose total loan amount is greater than ₹500,000, and show the highest total loan amount first.

Tables:
customers
loan_applications
Connection:
customer_id
Filter:
city = Chennai
Group:
customer
Calculate:
SUM(loan_amount)
Group filter:
SUM > 500000
Sort:
DESC

SELECT
    c.customer_id,
    c.customer_name,
    SUM(l.loan_amount) AS total_loan_amount
FROM customers c
JOIN loan_applications l
    ON c.customer_id = l.customer_id
WHERE c.city = 'Chennai'
GROUP BY
    c.customer_id,
    c.customer_name
HAVING SUM(l.loan_amount) > 500000
ORDER BY total_loan_amount DESC;

